  "title": "Tuscan Tomato Soup (Pappa al Pomodoro)",
  "description": "Known in Tuscany and all over Italy as &#34;Pappa al pomodoro&#34;, this thick soup is made with tomatoes, vegetables, Parmesan, and day-old bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Roberta"
  ],
